---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q8"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |  Sort: l_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Projection: date_part(Utf8("YEAR"),oorder.o_entry_d) AS l_year, sum(CASE WHEN n2.n_name = Utf8("INDIA") THEN order_line.ol_amount ELSE Int64(0) END) / sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS mkt_share                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), oorder.o_entry_d)]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN n2.n_name = Utf8("INDIA") THEN order_line.ol_amount ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: n1.n_regionkey = region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: supplier.su_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: n1.n_nationkey = ascii(substr(customer.c_state, Int64(1), Int64(1))) - Int64(65)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: customer.c_id = oorder.o_c_id AND customer.c_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND customer.c_d_id = oorder.o_d_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND order_line.ol_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND order_line.ol_o_id = oorder.o_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id AND order_line.ol_supply_w_id = stock.s_w_id AND item.i_id = order_line.ol_i_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: item.i_id = stock.s_i_id AND mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id, Int64(10000)) = supplier.su_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                       TableScan: item projection=[i_id], full_filters=[item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%b")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                       TableScan: supplier projection=[su_suppkey, su_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                     TableScan: stock projection=[s_i_id, s_w_id]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_o_id, ol_d_id, ol_w_id, ol_i_id, ol_supply_w_id, ol_amount], full_filters=[order_line.ol_i_id < Int64(1000)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 TableScan: oorder projection=[o_id, o_d_id, o_w_id, o_c_id, o_entry_d]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               TableScan: customer projection=[c_id, c_d_id, c_w_id, c_state]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |             SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: region projection=[r_regionkey], full_filters=[region.r_name = Utf8("ASIA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT date_part('YEAR', "oorder"."o_entry_d") AS "l_year", (sum(CASE WHEN ("n2"."n_name" = 'INDIA') THEN "order_line"."ol_amount" ELSE 0 END) // sum("order_line"."ol_amount")) AS "mkt_share" FROM "item" INNER JOIN "supplier" ON "item"."i_data" LIKE '%b' INNER JOIN "stock" ON (("item"."i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND (mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000) = "supplier"."su_suppkey")) INNER JOIN "order_line" ON (((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_supply_w_id" = "stock"."s_w_id")) AND ("item"."i_id" = "order_line"."ol_i_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_i_id" < 1000)) INNER JOIN "oorder" ON ((("order_line"."ol_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_o_id" = "oorder"."o_id")) INNER JOIN "customer" ON ((("customer"."c_id" = "oorder"."o_c_id") AND ("customer"."c_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id")) AND ("customer"."c_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) INNER JOIN "nation" AS "n1" ON ("n1"."n_nationkey" = (ascii(substr("customer"."c_state", 1, 1)) - 65)) INNER JOIN "nation" AS "n2" ON ("supplier"."su_nationkey" = "n2"."n_nationkey") INNER JOIN "region" ON (("n1"."n_regionkey" = "region"."r_regionkey") AND ("region"."r_name" = 'ASIA')) GROUP BY date_part('YEAR', "oorder"."o_entry_d") ORDER BY "l_year" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
